error[ffi_tag_is_a_union]: `fixedbugs-157-unions.h` declares `colour` as an `enum`, not a struct — C keeps the two in one namespace and will not let one stand for the other
  at tests/golden/unsupported/fixedbugs-157-a-record-over-an-enum-s-tag.hero:8:19
    |
  8 |     record CR tag colour  #~ ffi_tag_is_a_union
